  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Analysis to Strengthen Robust Interventions to the Myanmar Conflict_2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen strategic interventions and policies that support a long-term, political solution to the Myanmar conflict. The followings are the expected results of the project:

-Conduct Eight strategic meetings with Key partners between CPCS Myanmar team and key national stakeholders, external actors that engage in peace process.

- Conduct three conflict analysis meetings with key people to engage in deep, critical analysis of Myanmar conflict. (Political, EAO, civilian)

- Produce three conflict analysis papers that include clear, concise analysis of key issues and developments, highlighting concerning trends as well as recommendations for strategic interventions and key messages to inform international stakeholders policies and interventions towards Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
